OL,3,GNEWSALithium-ion battery caused fire
OL,4,Athat killed mum and 3 children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fatal house fire that killed a mother
OL,7,Fand her three children was caused by a
OL,8,Flithium-ion battery, the fire service
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FElisha Brabin, 36, and her children,
OL,12,FLeo, 16, Ellis, eight, and Prudence,
OL,13,Fseven, died after a blaze "spread
OL,14,Frapidly" inside a house on Stone Square
OL,15,Fin Bootle, Merseyside, in the early
OL,16,Fhours of 22 September.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
